# GPIO HAL API Reference

## Overview

The GPIO HAL (Hardware Abstraction Layer) provides a portable interface for configuring and controlling GPIO pins. It supports pin direction, pull resistors, interrupt handling, and ISR registration.

> **Note:** `gpio_hal_init()` must be called once before using any other GPIO HAL API.

---

